  "name": "pulsevr_threshold_check",
  "description": "Recomputes subscription thresholds for PulseVR review: subscribers needed for $1M/year and $1M/day, gross and net of a platform fee, plus share of an addressable base and churn-adjusted year-1 revenue. Use when re-deriving revenue-per-subscriber arithmetic in devil's-advocate reviews.",
